  "worked_solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}\\theta }(\\operatorname{csch}\u2061\\theta )=-\\operatorname{csch}\u2061\\theta \\operatorname{coth}\u2061\\theta \\,\u21d2\\,\\int \\operatorname{csch}\u2061\\theta \\operatorname{coth}\u2061\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta =-\\operatorname{csch}\u2061\\theta +C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 5\\operatorname{coth}\u2061\\theta \\operatorname{csch}\u2061\\theta \\,\\text{d}x & =5\\int \\operatorname{csch}\u2061\\theta \\operatorname{coth}\u2061\\theta \\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-5\\operatorname{csch}\u2061\\theta +C.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
